      "en": "In the world of the factory all that there remains of nature is man, the companion, the fellow being. If you were alone in it you would die. No trees, no plants, no dogs. Everything you touch is hard, dense; next to it the soft stuff of which your hand is made seems very fragile. In that fluid world of metal it is reassuring to meet a comrade."
